# WP-055 golden: Unbinding Lance pierces two dummies, then the charged form (record with `lf-tools replay record-script`). Each line:
# <ticks> <move_x> <move_z> [BUTTONS], plus `cmd` lines. The player rests at the Lantern,
# raises Insight by 20 (the spell's requirement), attunes the spell to the first
# attunement slot (slot 32), and casts it. Stylus, Glimmer, and known spells come from
# the `spell_range` scenario.
seed 5509
scenario spell_range
10 0 0            # settle on the ground
cmd Rest
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd Equip 32 15008      # attune
2 0 0
1 0 0 LIGHT     # the lance: through dummy_front and dummy_far
90 0 0
cmd Rest         # refill FP
2 0 0
1 0 0 HEAVY     # the charged form
130 0 0
